---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout class="about" title="About">
  <main class="region-content about">
    <div class="region">
      <div class="column column-first">
        <div class="field-body">
          <div class="field-label">
            <span>About</span>
          </div>

          <h1>Nice to meet you</h1>
          <div class="field-heading">
            <p>Let me introduce myself, first.</p>
          </div>

          <p>
            I'm a 25 graphic designer from Lausanne, Switzerland. I graduated
            from the school eracom on June 2024.
          </p>

          <p>
            Creative. Organised. Passionate. Independent. Attentive. Driven.
            Hard worker.
          </p>

          <p>
            I had the chance to accomplish some graphic and illustration works
            for Swiss buisnesses as a freelancer graphic designer. My working
            experiences in Japan and Taiwan were more than internships - they
            have shaped the way I approach design today. I design with
            intention, combining the structure and clarity of Swiss graphic
            design with a strong interest in illustration, visual
            experimentation and international design cultures.
            <br />
            My experience as a Project Leader Graphic Designer at Bytheway studio
            has allowed me to take on a more strategic and collaborative role. I
            worked on a wide range of projects for clients such as Étude Delta, Nova
            Fribourg, Welcome Spot, Corvatsch Park Pipe Finals and Morat-Fribourg,
            managing projects from the first brief to the final delivery. This experience
            strengthened my ability to combine creative direction, client communication
            and project management.
          </p>

          <div class="field-action">
            <p>
              <a href="/contact" title="Contact me"> Contact me now.</a><br />
              Or see my works<br />
              <a href="/works" title="See my works">here</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="column column-second">
        <div class="field-image">
          <div class="background">
            <img
              src="/portfolio-about.png"
              alt="Picture of me, Chiara Mendolia, your future graphic designer!?"
              width="200"
              height="200"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
